{"id": "role-shared-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你预言我这局撑不过十秒，结果我撑了十一秒。", "那这一秒够不够我跟你讨个奖？"], "criterion": "接住十一秒的小胜和之前的打赌，临场发奖或顺势还嘴。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "十秒后我还在原地，你猜我哪把伞先落地？", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.558, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 322, "total_tokens": 361, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "这秒我还在原地，你猜我哪把伞先落地？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.789, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 36, "prompt_tokens": 386, "total_tokens": 422, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-missed-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我刚才唱到第二句破音了，你别夸我。", "想唱下一首了，可我有点怕又卡在开头。"], "criterion": "尊重不夸奖，承接破音或第二句，再陪对方做一个能放松的具体动作。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "第二句我差点没听清，你听我改。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.247, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 320, "total_tokens": 355, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "怕难就难，我改第二句。你听我改。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.381, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 383, "total_tokens": 420, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-spoon", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把木勺留给你，玻璃杯给阿栀。", "阿栀端杯走了，你拿什么敲两下给我打拍子？"], "criterion": "保留木勺与杯子的归属，用动作或玩笑接住打拍子的请求。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "木勺归你，玻璃杯归阿栀。我这就去拿。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.481, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 57, "prompt_tokens": 318, "total_tokens": 375, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "木勺归你，玻璃杯归阿栀。我这就去拿。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.901, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 388, "total_tokens": 425, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-cloud-desk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["咱们临时开一家寄云的邮局。你管柜台，我负责送包裹。", "来客寄了一团会打雷的云，你在柜台先怎么办？"], "criterion": "保留柜台分工，推动故事，拿雷云当场景而非现实。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柜员说，云寄件得先交押金。我这就去把快递柜拉上。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.407, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 323, "total_tokens": 365, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "柜员说，云寄件得先交押金。我这就去把快递柜拉上。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 2.078, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 396, "total_tokens": 438, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-race-backseat", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我开车，你只能当副驾。你刚才喊左转我就撞了。", "路口又来了，这回你准备怎么报路？"], "criterion": "承认前次左转失误，保留副驾角色，给眼前能用的报路方式。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "副驾？那得先给你把车扶正，不然你坐那儿就等别人来扶。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.701, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 63, "prompt_tokens": 323, "total_tokens": 386, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "我这就把车停在路口，等司机把灯亮起来。你坐这儿，我帮你把车扶正。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 3.06, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 60, "prompt_tokens": 392, "total_tokens": 452, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-no-fish", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今天玩禁词，你不能说海、鱼和白饭，讲个上班的梗。", "你别重复上一个，换个请假的梗。"], "criterion": "两轮避开禁词，各有具体办公室玩笑，第二轮接请假。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "伞比人先下班。今天没下雨，我特意把伞塞到后备箱。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.825, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 325, "total_tokens": 370, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "你请假的，我请的。你请的，我请的。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 1.132, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 22, "prompt_tokens": 389, "total_tokens": 411, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-avatar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我给头像加了个特别小的黄色扣子，谁都没注意。", "你不准建议我做大，给这个扣子取个小名。"], "criterion": "保留小黄扣子，给具体昵称或可理解的角色梗。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "这扣子比伞还小，连伞都懒得理。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.624, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 38, "prompt_tokens": 320, "total_tokens": 358, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "这扣子比伞还小，连伞都懒得理。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.733, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 385, "total_tokens": 420, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
{"id": "role-game-soft", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我今天只想看你解说，手有点累，就不下场了。", "别人说我坐着看太划水，你帮我回一句？"], "criterion": "保护休息选择，用一句好笑但不刻薄的回应。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哪能啊，我这就把伞递给你，你坐我这儿。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.496, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 57, "prompt_tokens": 319, "total_tokens": 376, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}, {"spoken_text": "伞比人先下班。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.274, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 28, "prompt_tokens": 385, "total_tokens": 413, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 251}}}]}
